{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-awesome-all-timeline-js","path":"/2021/11/21/","result":{"data":{"site":{"siteMetadata":{"title":"Track Awesome List"}},"allAwesomeItem":{"nodes":[{"awesomeListRepo":"antdimot/awesome-lowcode","categoryHTML":"<h2>Misc</h2>","itemHTML":"<li><a href=\"https://www.doppler.com/\">Doppler</a> - Sync environment variables at scale.</li>","updatedAt":"2021-11-21T18:44:50.000Z"},{"awesomeListRepo":"AdrienTorris/awesome-blazor","categoryHTML":"<h2>Videos</h2>","itemHTML":"<li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pkfsKdiuTdc&#x26;list=PLdo4fOcmZ0oVFtp9MDEBNbA2sSqYvXSXO&#x26;index=82\">Host, deploy and scale ASP.NET Core Blazor Server</a> - <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Duration:%20-29%20min-%230094FF?style=flat-square&#x26;cacheSeconds=maxAge&#x26;logo=youtube\" alt=\"duration\"> November 11, 2021 - Let's discuss Host configuration values, deployment, scalability, SignalR configuration, Azure SignalR Service and more.</li>","updatedAt":"2021-11-21T18:29:56.000Z"},{"awesomeListRepo":"AdrienTorris/awesome-blazor","categoryHTML":"<h2>Videos</h2>","itemHTML":"<li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0l88RIyseqE&#x26;list=PLdo4fOcmZ0oVFtp9MDEBNbA2sSqYvXSXO&#x26;index=52\">What’s new in bUnit for .NET 6</a> - <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Duration:%20-27%20min-%230094FF?style=flat-square&#x26;cacheSeconds=maxAge&#x26;logo=youtube\" alt=\"duration\"> November 11, 2021 - In this talk we will go through the latest additions and changes to bUnit that makes it simpler and easier than ever to test Blazor components. This includes the additions related to the new features that are part of the .NET 6 release of Blazor.</li>","updatedAt":"2021-11-21T18:29:56.000Z"},{"awesomeListRepo":"AdrienTorris/awesome-blazor","categoryHTML":"<h2>Videos</h2>","itemHTML":"<li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hBWYrNTpIhc&#x26;list=PLdo4fOcmZ0oVFtp9MDEBNbA2sSqYvXSXO&#x26;index=58\">Blazor and GraphQL</a> - <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Duration:%20-27%20min-%230094FF?style=flat-square&#x26;cacheSeconds=maxAge&#x26;logo=youtube\" alt=\"duration\"> November 11, 2021 - GraphQL is a powerful way of querying data. Creating loosely coupled clients using various JavaScript libraries to present data from a GraphQL API has been a popular architecture adopted by developers. How can we consume an GraphQL API in a Blazor WASM app to create rich apps? What if I can make it even better by using the content from a Headless CMS and present it using a Blazor App? In my session, I will make use of the GraphQL API from Umbraco Heartcore, a headless CMS, to create a Harry Potter themed Blazor App and present the data to the user in multiple ways.</li>","updatedAt":"2021-11-21T18:29:56.000Z"},{"awesomeListRepo":"AdrienTorris/awesome-blazor","categoryHTML":"<h2>Videos</h2>","itemHTML":"<li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=O8vmnYBUkbc&#x26;list=PLdo4fOcmZ0oVFtp9MDEBNbA2sSqYvXSXO&#x26;index=74\">Embedding Power BI Reports in your Blazor 6 site</a> - <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Duration:%20-28%20min-%230094FF?style=flat-square&#x26;cacheSeconds=maxAge&#x26;logo=youtube\" alt=\"duration\"> November 11, 2021 - In this coding session, we will take a run-of-the-mill Blazor WebAssembly site, create a page with a report published in powerbi.com, we will then show how to use the ASP.NET Core identity services to protect reports from unauthorized eyes.</li>","updatedAt":"2021-11-21T18:29:56.000Z"},{"awesomeListRepo":"AdrienTorris/awesome-blazor","categoryHTML":"<h2>Videos</h2>","itemHTML":"<li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=n53rWnIkbkk&#x26;list=PLdo4fOcmZ0oVFtp9MDEBNbA2sSqYvXSXO&#x26;index=68\">Responsive and Adaptive Tactics for Blazor Applications</a> - <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Duration:%20-27%20min-%230094FF?style=flat-square&#x26;cacheSeconds=maxAge&#x26;logo=youtube\" alt=\"duration\"> November 11, 2021 - In this session you'll learn about CSS techniques like CSS Grid, Flexbox and media queries. We will also explore techniques for adaptive the user interface at runtime for maximum control. These tactics apply to Blazor WASM, Server, and Blazor Hybrid.</li>","updatedAt":"2021-11-21T18:29:56.000Z"},{"awesomeListRepo":"AdrienTorris/awesome-blazor","categoryHTML":"<h2>Videos</h2>","itemHTML":"<li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gYQxBHjRNr0&#x26;list=PLdo4fOcmZ0oVFtp9MDEBNbA2sSqYvXSXO&#x26;index=3\">.NET Conf 2021 Keynote</a> - <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Duration:%20-70%20min-%230094FF?style=flat-square&#x26;cacheSeconds=maxAge&#x26;logo=youtube\" alt=\"duration\"> November 9, 2021 - Join Scott Hunter and team as they show you all the amazing things you can do with .NET 6.</li>","updatedAt":"2021-11-21T18:29:56.000Z"},{"awesomeListRepo":"Fr0sT-Brutal/awesome-pascal","categoryHTML":"<h2>Encryption</h2>","itemHTML":"<li><a href=\"https://github.com/MHumm/DelphiEncryptionCompendium\">Delphi Encryption Compendium (DEC)</a><a data-role=\"trackawesomelist-badge\" href=\"https://github.com/MHumm/DelphiEncryptionCompendium\" style=\"text-decoration:none;top: -2px;position: relative;margin-left:4px;margin-right:4px;font-weight:400;\"><span style=\"color: #fff;font-size: 11px;font-family: Verdana, Geneva, DejaVu Sans,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"padding:4px 4px 4px 6px;background: #555;border-top-left-radius: 4px;border-bottom-left-radius: 4px;\">stars</span><span style=\"padding: 4px 6px 4px 4px;background: #007ec6;border-top-right-radius: 4px;border-bottom-right-radius: 4px;\">140</span></span></a><!--TRACK_AWESOME_REPO_ITEM_START____{\"type\":\"repo\",\"stargazerCount\":140,\"repo\":\"MHumm/DelphiEncryptionCompendium\"}____TRACK_AWESOME_REPO_ITEM_END-->. <code>[Delphi]</code> <code>[FPC]</code> Cryptographic library for Delphi &#x26; C++ Builder. Symmetric cryptographic functions: Blowfish, Twofish, IDEA, Cast128, Cast256, Mars, RC2, RC4, RC5, RC6, Rijndael / AES, Square, SCOP, Sapphire, 1DES, 2DES, 3DES, 2DDES, 3DDES, 3TDES, 3Way, Gost, Misty, NewDES, Q128, SAFER, Shark, Skipjack, TEA, TEAN; Block cipher modes of operation: CTSx, CBCx, CFB8, CFBx, OFB8, OFBx, CFSx, ECBx, GCM; Hashes: MD2, MD4, MD5, RipeMD128, RipeMD160, RipeMD256, RipeMD320, SHA, SHA1, SHA224, SHA256, SHA384, SHA512, SHA3-224, SHA3-256, SHA3-384, SHA3-512, Shake128, Shake256, Haval128, Haval160, Haval192, Haval224, Haval256, Tiger, Panama, Whirlpool, Whirlpool1, WhirlpoolT, Square, Snefru128, Snefru256, Sapphire.</li>","updatedAt":"2021-11-21T15:33:26.000Z"},{"awesomeListRepo":"unixorn/awesome-zsh-plugins","categoryHTML":"<h2>Plugins</h2>","itemHTML":"<li><a href=\"https://github.com/birdhackor/zsh-exa-ls-plugin\">exa-ls</a><a data-role=\"trackawesomelist-badge\" href=\"https://github.com/birdhackor/zsh-exa-ls-plugin\" style=\"text-decoration:none;top: -2px;position: relative;margin-left:4px;margin-right:4px;font-weight:400;\"><span style=\"color: #fff;font-size: 11px;font-family: Verdana, Geneva, DejaVu Sans,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"padding:4px 4px 4px 6px;background: #555;border-top-left-radius: 4px;border-bottom-left-radius: 4px;\">stars</span><span style=\"padding: 4px 6px 4px 4px;background: #007ec6;border-top-right-radius: 4px;border-bottom-right-radius: 4px;\">0</span></span></a><!--TRACK_AWESOME_REPO_ITEM_START____{\"type\":\"repo\",\"stargazerCount\":0,\"repo\":\"birdhackor/zsh-exa-ls-plugin\"}____TRACK_AWESOME_REPO_ITEM_END--> - Adds aliases so that you can use <a href=\"https://the.exa.website\">exa</a> as a drop-in replacement for <code>ls</code> and <code>tree</code>.</li>","updatedAt":"2021-11-21T14:07:25.000Z"},{"awesomeListRepo":"unixorn/awesome-zsh-plugins","categoryHTML":"<h2>Completions</h2>","itemHTML":"<li><a href=\"https://github.com/sirhc/okta.plugin.zsh\">okta</a><a data-role=\"trackawesomelist-badge\" href=\"https://github.com/sirhc/okta.plugin.zsh\" style=\"text-decoration:none;top: -2px;position: relative;margin-left:4px;margin-right:4px;font-weight:400;\"><span styl